---
description: TDD Workflow for Server-Side Development with MongoDB that guides implementation through structured stages of test creation, implementation, verification, and performance optimization while maintaining context tracking in a MongoDB database
globs: 
alwaysApply: false
---


AI Directive Tree
└── Reset Context [to-do]
    ├── Check Current Directory and Workspace Status [to-do]
    ├── Run Context Verification Script: {Make File: .cursor/rules/tdd/scripts/verify-context.sh} [to-do]
    ├── Reset Internal Context State [to-do]
    ├── Confirm Reset Success [to-do]
    ├── Update Running Context in {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/context/active-working-context.mdc`} [to-do]
    └── Special Note: Keep Everything Simple and Follow File Paths Exactly [to-do]

└── Select Feature from Files [to-do]
    ├── Read Feature Rules from {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/features/feature-registry.mdc`} [to-do]
    ├── Select Feature with [planned] or [ready] Status [to-do]
    ├── Update Feature Status to [in-progress] [to-do]
    ├── Create/Update Implementation File in {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/features/{feature-name-with-hyphens}-implementation.mdc`} [to-do]
    ├── Update {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/context/active-working-context.mdc`} and {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/context/context-persistence.mdc`} [to-do]
    ├── Run Script: {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/scripts/sync-context.sh`} "{FeatureName}" "init" "in-progress" [to-do]
    ├── Special Note: Simplicity First—Focus on Core Functionality Only [to-do]
    └── Special Note: Verify File Paths Are Correct [to-do]

└── Build a Failing Test [to-do]
    ├── Identify the Sub-Feature to Implement [to-do]
    ├── Create/Update Test File at {Make File: `server/tdd/tests/{FeatureName}.test.ts`} [to-do]
    ├── Run Test Path Verification: {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/scripts/verify-test-path.sh`} "{FeatureName}" [to-do]
    ├── Implement Test Based on Feature Rules [to-do]
    ├── Ensure Test Accurately Represents Missing Functionality [to-do]
    ├── Update Sub-Feature Status to [test-failing] [to-do]
    ├── Update Running Context in {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/context/active-working-context.mdc`} [to-do]
    ├── Run Script: {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/scripts/sync-context.sh`} "{FeatureName}" "{SubFeatureName}" "test-failing" [to-do]
    ├── Special Note: Simplicity in Test Design—No Unnecessary Complexity [to-do]
    └── Special Note: Comment Test Purpose Clearly for Future AI Review [to-do]

└── Run Failing Test to Verify It Fails [to-do]
    ├── Execute Test: {Make File: `server/tdd/scripts/run-test.sh`} -t '{specific test name}' [to-do]
    ├── Verify Full Test File: {Make File: `server/tdd/scripts/run-test.sh`} --file={FeatureName}.test.ts [to-do]
    ├── Ensure Failure Matches Expectations [to-do]
    ├── Update Running Context in {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/context/active-working-context.mdc`} [to-do]
    ├── Verify Context Synchronization: {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/scripts/verify-context.sh`} [to-do]
    └── Special Note: Failure is Expected—Do Not Adjust Test Prematurely [to-do]

└── Implement Minimal Fix [to-do]
    ├── Load {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/workflow-states/implementing-feature.mdc`} Workflow State [to-do]
    ├── Create Implementation Plan [to-do]
    ├── Make the Smallest Change Necessary to Pass Test [to-do]
    ├── Ensure Fix Aligns with Feature Rules [to-do]
    ├── Avoid Unintended Modifications [to-do]
    ├── Update Sub-Feature Status to [implementing] [to-do]
    ├── Update Running Context in {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/context/active-working-context.mdc`} [to-do]
    ├── Run Script: {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/scripts/sync-context.sh`} "{FeatureName}" "{SubFeatureName}" "implementing" [to-do]
    ├── Special Note: Simplicity—Only Fix What's Needed [to-do]
    └── Special Note: Comment Fix Purpose to Prevent Accidental Removal [to-do]

└── Run Test to Verify Fix [to-do]
    ├── Execute Test: {Make File: `server/tdd/scripts/run-test.sh`} -t '{specific test name}' [to-do]
    ├── Ensure Fix Resolves the Intended Issue [to-do]
    ├── Update Sub-Feature Status to [test-passing] [to-do]
    ├── Update Running Context in {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/context/active-working-context.mdc`} [to-do]
    ├── Run Script: {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/scripts/sync-context.sh`} "{FeatureName}" "{SubFeatureName}" "test-passing" [to-do]
    ├── Special Note: If Fix Fails, Reassess Simplicity and Correctness [to-do]
    └── Special Note: Comment Test Adjustments Clearly [to-do]

└── Run All Tests to Ensure No Other Tests Break [to-do]
    ├── Execute All Tests: {Make File: `server/tdd/scripts/run-test.sh`} --suite={FeatureName} [to-do]
    ├── If Any Tests Fail: [to-do]
    │   ├── Identify Cause of Failure [to-do]
    │   ├── Adjust Fix or Tests Accordingly [to-do]
    │   ├── Re-run All Tests Until They Pass [to-do]
    │   └── Special Note: Debugging Should Be Minimal and Targeted [to-do]
    ├── Update Running Context in {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/context/active-working-context.mdc`} [to-do]
    ├── Run Script: {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/scripts/verify-context.sh`} [to-do]
    ├── Special Note: If Unexpected Failures Occur, Revalidate Simplicity [to-do]
    └── Special Note: Comment Any Necessary Adjustments for Clarity [to-do]

└── Performance Check [to-do]
    ├── Execute Performance Test: {Make File: `server/tdd/scripts/performance-test.sh`} --feature={FeatureName} [to-do]
    ├── Ensure No Major Performance Regressions [to-do]
    ├── Confirm That Feature Meets Efficiency Standards [to-do]
    ├── Update Running Context in {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/context/active-working-context.mdc`} [to-do]
    ├── Special Note: Simplicity—Optimize Only If Necessary [to-do]
    └── Special Note: Comment Performance-Related Changes to Justify Them [to-do]

└── Feature Completion or Iteration [to-do]
    ├── If More Sub-Features Remain: [to-do]
    │   ├── Return to "Build a Failing Test" Step for Next Sub-Feature [to-do]
    │   └── Continue Until All Sub-Features are Implemented [to-do]
    ├── If Feature is Complete: [to-do]
    │   ├── Update Feature Status to [done] in {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/features/feature-registry.mdc`} [to-do]
    │   ├── Run Script: {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/scripts/sync-context.sh`} "{FeatureName}" "complete" "done" [to-do]
    │   ├── Load {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/workflow-states/transitioning-features.mdc`} Workflow State [to-do]
    │   └── Prepare for Next Feature Selection [to-do]
    ├── Update Running Context in {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/context/active-working-context.mdc`} [to-do]
    ├── Run Script: {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/scripts/verify-context.sh`} [to-do]
    └── Special Note: Document the Feature Status Change [to-do]

└── Pause and Wait [to-do]
    ├── Allow for Manual Review Before Proceeding [to-do]
    ├── Update Running Context in {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/context/active-working-context.mdc`} [to-do]
    ├── Run Script: {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/scripts/reset-workflow-state.sh`} to Prevent Accidental Loops [to-do]
    ├── Run Script: {Make File: `.cursor/rules/tdd/scripts/verify-context.sh`} [to-do]
    ├── Special Note: No Action Should Be Taken Until Explicitly Directed [to-do]
    └── Special Note: Final Comments Should Summarize What Was Done and Why [to-do]
    